{"message":"For a personal checking account, the Bluest Account appears strongest for international ATM use: Rho charges $0 for foreign ATM withdrawals and rebates third-party ATM operator fees up to $50 per monthly statement cycle. The ATM operator may still charge fees above that cap.

The Purple Account also has 0% foreign-currency transaction fees and refunds ATM-operator fees up to $30 per month, but its international ATM fee itself is not specified in the available details. Its ATM withdrawal limit is $1,000 per day.

If this will be a business account, World Blue has $0 Rho foreign-ATM fees and rebates operator fees up to $100 per calendar month, but it carries a $50 monthly maintenance fee and requires a $10,000 balance. Please confirm whether you need a personal or business account—and, if personal, your expected monthly cash withdrawals—so I can compare the total likely cost more precisely."}
